"nen/tree": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# trang trí: tree — sinh bằng tools/ve-pixel.html (2026-10-08), chỉnh tay trong tool.\n# Mô tả: cây tán tròn xanh tối 1E3418/2D4E22\nname: trang trí: tree\nsize: 32x32\ncolors:\n  a = vien\n  b = dat-toi\n  c = dat\n  d = dat-sang\n  e = la-toi\n  f = la\n  g = la-ma\n\npart k0\n................................\n..............aaaa..............\n..........aaaagggeaaaa..........\n........aaggggffffgggeaa........\n.......aggffffffffffffgea.......\n......agffffffffffffffffea......\n.....agffffffffffffffffffea.....\n....agffffffffffffffffffffea....\n....agffffffffffffffffffffea....\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffgfffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agfffffffffffffffgffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...agffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n...aeffffffffffffffffffffffea...\n....aeffffffffffffffffffffea....\n.....aeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeea.....\n......aaaaaaadccccbaaaaaaa......\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............adccccba............\n............abbbbbba............\n.............aaaaaa.............\n................................\nend\n\nanim main fps=1 once\nframe main\n  use k0\nend\n"},
"quai/camap": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Cá Mập Yêu (mã camap) — quái thường 32×32, hành Thủy, [hoá điên]. Quy chuẩn: docs/pixel/QUY-CHUAN.md\n# Đặc trưng (PROMPT-GEN-LAI.txt:292 FIX: cá mập THẬT thân thoi xám, vây lưng to, đứng trên vây đuôi khuyết, nhe răng cười — không tay chân;\n# PROMPT-DUNG-XUONG.txt:1324 vòng đồng ở vây). Phá cách (DANH-SACH): \"cá mập thuyền đắm\" — mảnh ván thuyền vỡ cắm lưng, dây neo quấn thân.\nname: Cá Mập Yêu\nsize: 32x32\nanchor: 15,30\ncolors:\n  k = vien\n  G = sat-sang\n  g = sat\n  t = sat-toi\n  b = trang\n  B = trang-xam\n  h = trang\n  m = son-toi\n  D = toi\n  e = vang-sang\n  w = dong\n  W = vang-nghe\n  p = dat-sang\n  P = dat\n  q = dat-toi\n  r = cat\n  R = dong-toi\n\npart than\n................................\n................................\n...................gt...........\n.................GGggt..........\n...............GGGgggtt.........\n..............GGgDDggggt........\n.............GGgggeDgggggt......\n............GGgggggggggggg......\n............GGgggggtmmmmmm......\n...........GGgggggtmhmhmhm......\n...........GGggggtBmmhmhmB......\n...........GGgggtgbbBBBBB.......\n..........GGgggtgtbbbbbB........\n..........GGgggtgtbbbB..........\n.........GGggggtgtbbbB..........\n.........GGgggggtbbbbB..........\n.........GGggggggtbbB...........\n.........GGgggggtbbbB...........\n.........GGgggggtbbB............\n.........GGggggttbbB............\n..........Gggggttbb.............\n..........GGgggtbbB.............\n...........Ggggtbb..............\n...........GGggtbB..............\n............Gggtb...............\n.............Ggt................\n................................\n................................\n................................\n................................\n................................\n................................\nend\n\n# vây lưng to (sau lưng, chĩa lên-trái) + vòng đồng\npart vay_lung\n......G\n.....GG\n....GGg\n...GGgg\n..GGggg\n.GGgggg\nGGggWwt\nGgggwRt\n..ggtt.\nend\n\npart duoi\nGG..........GG\nGGg........Ggt\n.GGg......Ggt.\n..GGggggggggt.\n...GGggggggt..\n....tttttt....\nend\n\npart vay_nguc\nGgg..\n.gggt\n..gtt\n...t.\nend\n\npart vay_nguc2\nGggt\n.gtt\nend\n\npart van\n....pP\n...ppP\n..pPPq\n.pPPq.\npPPq..\n.Pq...\nend\n\npart day\nrrRrrRr.\n.RrrRrrR\nend\n\npart mat_nham\nDD\nend\n\npart ha\ntmmmmmmm\nmhmhmhmh\nmmmmmmmm\nmmmmmmmm\nBhmhmhmB\n.bbbbBB.\nend\n\npart duoi_ep\nGGg........GGt\n.GGggggggggggt\n..GGgggggggtt.\n...tttttttt...\nend\n\npart mat_x\nGGGG\nDGDG\nGDGG\nDGDG\nend\n\nanim walk fps=6 loop\nframe walk\n  use vay_lung 3 8\n  use van 3 15\n  use than 0 0\n  use vay_nguc 20 15\n  use day 10 19\n  use duoi 8 24\n  outline\nend\nframe walk\n  use vay_lung 3 7\n  use van 3 14\n  use than 0 -1\n  use vay_nguc2 20 14\n  use day 10 18\n  use duoi 8 24\n  outline\nend\nframe walk\n  use vay_lung 3 8\n  use van 3 15\n  use than 0 0\n  use vay_nguc 20 15\n  use day 10 19\n  use duoi_ep 8 25\n  outline\nend\nframe walk\n  use vay_lung 4 7\n  use van 4 14\n  use than 1 -1\n  use vay_nguc2 21 14\n  use day 11 18\n  use duoi 8 24\n  outline\nend\n\nanim attack fps=8 once\nframe attack\n  use vay_lung 2 9\n  use van 2 16\n  use than -1 1\n  use vay_nguc2 19 16\n  use day 9 20\n  use duoi_ep 8 25\n  outline\nend\nframe attack\n  use vay_lung 5 7\n  use van 5 14\n  use than 2 -1\n  use vay_nguc 22 14\n  use day 12 18\n  use ha 20 7\n  use duoi 8 24\n  outline\nend\nframe attack\n  use @walk.0\nend\n\nanim hurt fps=8 once\nframe hurt\n  use vay_lung 1 9\n  use van 1 16\n  use than -2 1\n  use vay_nguc2 18 16\n  use day 8 20\n  use ha 16 9\n  use mat_x 15 5\n  use duoi 8 24\n  outline\n  swap g G\n  swap t g\nend\n\nanim die fps=5 once\nframe die\n  use vay_lung 2 9\n  use van 2 16\n  use than -1 1\n  use vay_nguc2 19 16\n  use day 9 20\n  use mat_nham 17 7\n  use duoi_ep 8 25\n  outline\nend\nframe die\n  use vay_lung 3 8\n  use van 3 15\n  use than 0 0\n  use vay_nguc2 20 15\n  use day 10 19\n  use mat_nham 18 6\n  use duoi 8 24\n  rot 90\n  shift 0 3\n  outline\nend\nframe die\n  use @die.1\n  swap g t\n  swap G g\n  swap b B\nend\n"},
