"vfx/giot-nuoc": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Giọt Nước Thánh (tinh anh \"Nước Thánh\", hồi máu) — giọt nước ngọc lam, ánh trắng.\nname: Giọt nước thánh\nsize: 8x10\nanchor: 4,9\ncolors:\n  k = cham-toi\n  n = ngoc\n  N = ngoc-sang\n  x = sang\npart a\n........\n....n...\n...nn...\n..nNnn..\n..nxNn..\n.nNNnnn.\n.nNnnnn.\n..nnnn..\n........\n........\nend\nanim main fps=1 loop\nframe main\n  use a\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/ho-ba-vi": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Hổ Ba Vì (Thần Săn triệu hồi) — hổ vằn cam đất sọc đen nâu, vồ sang PHẢI (2 khung: thu mình / vồ).\nname: Hổ Ba Vì\nsize: 24x16\nanchor: 12,15\ncolors:\n  k = toi\n  o = lua\n  O = lua-sang\n  d = son-toi\n  w = trang\n  y = vang-nghe\npart a\n........................\n........................\n........................\n.................oo.o...\n................ooooo...\n.....dd.d.d....oOyOoo...\n...ooooooooooooOOOOwk...\n..ooodoodoodooooOOOw....\n.o.oooooooooooooOOo.....\no..ooooooooooooooo......\n...oO.oO......oO.oO.....\n...oo.oo......oo.oo.....\n........................\n........................\n........................\n........................\nend\npart b\n........................\n......................oo\n...................ooooo\n.......d.d.d......oOyOoo\n.....oooooooooooooOOOOwk\n...ooodoodoodooooooOOw..\n.oooooooooooooooooOOo...\no...oO..........oO......\n.....oO..........oO.....\n........................\n........................\n........................\n........................\n........................\n........................\n........................\nend\nanim main fps=4 loop\nframe main\n  use a 0 3\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use b 0 3\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/hoa-sen": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Cánh sen (hoa sen hồng nhạt viền son) — xoay 2 khung khi bay.\nname: Cánh sen\nsize: 9x9\nanchor: 4,4\ncolors:\n  k = son-toi\n  h = hong\n  w = trang\n  y = vang-nghe\npart a\n.........\n....h....\n...hwh...\n.h.hwh.h.\n.hhhyhhh.\n..hhhhh..\n...hhh...\n.........\n.........\nend\nanim main fps=8 loop\nframe main\n  use a\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use a\n  rot 90\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/hoi": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Hồi máu — mầm lá non nhú lên (sức sống Mộc), không dùng trái tim.\nname: Hồi máu\nsize: 9x9\nanchor: 4,8\ncolors:\n  k = la-toi\n  g = la-ma\n  l = la-sang\n  s = la\npart a\n.........\n..gg.....\n.glg..gg.\n..gsg.gl.\n....ss...\n....s....\n....s....\n.........\n.........\nend\nanim main fps=3 loop\nframe main\n  use a 0 1\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use a\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/khien-giap": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Dấu tinh anh \"Vỏ Cứng\" — khiên đồng nhỏ có núm, lơ lửng cạnh quái.\nname: Khiên giáp\nsize: 9x10\nanchor: 4,5\ncolors:\n  k = dong-toi\n  d = dong\n  D = dong-sang\n  y = vang-nghe\npart a\n.........\n..ddddd..\n.dDDDDdd.\n.dDDyDdd.\n.dDyyydd.\n.dDDyDdd.\n..dDDdd..\n...ddd...\n....d....\n.........\nend\nanim main fps=1 loop\nframe main\n  use a\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/khoi": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Cụm khói — xám sắt chuyển xám tối, phình ra rồi tan (quái chết, bụi chiêu, khói sau nổ).\nname: Khói\nsize: 12x12\nanchor: 6,6\ncolors:\n  k = sat-toi\n  s = sat\n  S = sat-sang\n  w = trang-xam\npart a\n....\n.SS.\n.Ss.\n....\nend\npart b\n........\n..SSw...\n.SwwSS..\n.SSSSss.\n..ssss..\n........\nend\npart c\n..........\n...SS.SS..\n..SwwSwwS.\n.SSwSSSSs.\n.SSSSSsss.\n..sSssss..\n...ss.ss..\n..........\nend\nanim main fps=8 once\nframe main\n  use a 4 4\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use b 2 3\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use c 1 2\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use c 1 2\n  swap w S\n  swap S s\nend\n"},
"vfx/kim-quang": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Ánh kim (hành Kim) — ánh bạc hình thoi loé lên, viền sắt tối.\nname: Ánh kim\nsize: 9x9\nanchor: 4,4\ncolors:\n  k = sat-toi\n  b = bac\n  x = sang\n  s = sat-sang\npart a\n.........\n....s....\n....b....\n...bxb...\n.sbxxxbs.\n...bxb...\n....b....\n....s....\n.........\nend\npart b\n.........\n.........\n.........\n....b....\n...bxb...\n....b....\n.........\n.........\n.........\nend\nanim main fps=10 once\nframe main\n  use a\nend\nframe main\n  use b\nend\n"},
