"vfx/ngua-sat": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Ngựa sắt phun lửa (Thánh Gióng) — ngựa giáp sắt tối, bờm lửa son, phi sang PHẢI (2 khung chân).\nname: Ngựa sắt\nsize: 24x18\nanchor: 12,17\ncolors:\n  k = vien\n  s = sat-toi\n  S = sat\n  b = sat-sang\n  r = son-sang\n  o = lua\n  y = vang-nghe\npart than\n........................\n........................\n..................SS....\n.............rorSSbS....\n............roryySSSbk..\n...o.o.....rorySSSSSSs..\n..oryo......ySSSSs.ss...\n.oryySSSSSSSSSSSSs......\n..roSSbbbbbbSSSSSs......\n....SSSSSSSSSSSSss......\n....SSSSSSSSSSSss.......\n........................\nend\npart chan1\n....S.S........S.S......\n...S...S......S...S.....\n..S.....S....S.....S....\nend\npart chan2\n......SS.......SS.......\n......SS.......SS.......\n.....S.S......S.S.......\nend\nanim main fps=8 loop\nframe main\n  use than 0 3\n  use chan1 0 14\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use than 0 3\n  use chan2 0 14\n  outline k\nend\n"},
"vfx/no": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Vụ nổ — lõi vàng nghệ, lửa son, tan thành khói sắt xám (màu trầm). Nổ lan, cầu lửa, thiên thạch, boss chết.\nname: Vụ nổ\nsize: 18x18\nanchor: 9,9\ncolors:\n  k = son-toi\n  r = son\n  o = lua\n  y = vang-nghe\n  Y = vang-sang\n  s = sat\n  S = sat-sang\n  d = sat-toi\npart f1\n......\n..oo..\n.oyyo.\n.oyYo.\n..oo..\n......\nend\npart f2\n..............\n......r.......\n..r..ror..r...\n...rroooorr...\n..rooyyyyoor..\n.rooyyYYyyoor.\nrroyyYYYYyyorr\n.rooyyYYyyoor.\n..rooyyyyoor..\n...rroooorr...\n..r..rorr..r..\n......r.......\n..............\nend\npart f3\n...............\n.....sSSss.....\n...sSsrrrsSs...\n..sSrrooorrSs..\n.sSroooyooorSs.\n.Srooyyyyyoors.\nsSroyyYYyyoorSs\n.Srooyyyyyoors.\n.sSroooyooorSs.\n..sSrroooorSs..\n...sSsrrrsSs...\n.....sSSss.....\n...............\nend\npart f4\n................\n.....sS..sS.....\n...sSss.ssSs....\n..sS..dd...Ss...\n.sS.d....d..Ss..\n.S..........s...\nsS.....r.....Ss.\n.S..........Ss..\n.sS.d....d..s...\n..sS..dd...Ss...\n...sSs..sSs.....\n.....sS.sS......\n................\nend\nanim main fps=10 once\nframe main\n  use f1 6 6\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use f2 2 3\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use f3 1 2\n  outline d\nend\nframe main\n  use f4 1 2\nend\n"},
