"vfx/no-moc": {"nguon":"nhánh chính","src":"# Vụ nổ hệ Mộc — lá rêu bung, lõi mạ non (đạn nổ lan của tướng hệ moc). Sinh từ no.txt bằng đổi màu.\nname: Vụ nổ hệ Mộc\nsize: 18x18\nanchor: 9,9\ncolors:\n  k = la-toi\n  r = la\n  o = la-ma\n  y = la-sang\n  Y = trang\n  s = sat\n  S = sat-sang\n  d = sat-toi\npart f1\n......\n..oo..\n.oyyo.\n.oyYo.\n..oo..\n......\nend\npart f2\n..............\n......r.......\n..r..ror..r...\n...rroooorr...\n..rooyyyyoor..\n.rooyyYYyyoor.\nrroyyYYYYyyorr\n.rooyyYYyyoor.\n..rooyyyyoor..\n...rroooorr...\n..r..rorr..r..\n......r.......\n..............\nend\npart f3\n...............\n.....sSSss.....\n...sSsrrrsSs...\n..sSrrooorrSs..\n.sSroooyooorSs.\n.Srooyyyyyoors.\nsSroyyYYyyoorSs\n.Srooyyyyyoors.\n.sSroooyooorSs.\n..sSrroooorSs..\n...sSsrrrsSs...\n.....sSSss.....\n...............\nend\npart f4\n................\n.....sS..sS.....\n...sSss.ssSs....\n..sS..dd...Ss...\n.sS.d....d..Ss..\n.S..........s...\nsS.....r.....Ss.\n.S..........Ss..\n.sS.d....d..s...\n..sS..dd...Ss...\n...sSs..sSs.....\n.....sS.sS......\n................\nend\nanim main fps=10 once\nframe main\n  use f1 6 6\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use f2 2 3\n  outline k\nend\nframe main\n  use f3 1 2\n  outline d\nend\nframe main\n  use f4 1 2\nend\n"},
